@startuml
actor Doctor
participant DoctorApp as App
participant Backend
participant Database
participant Daily

Doctor -> App : Start video call
App -> Backend : POST /api/video/token
Backend -> Database : Verify appointment and participants
Database --> Backend : Appointment data
Backend -> Daily : Request room/token
Daily --> Backend : Room URL / token
Backend -> App : 200 OK + video token
App -> Daily : Join room with token
@enduml

